{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15547","headline":"夏首犹清和 · 黎逢","name":"夏首犹清和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早夏宜初景，和光起禁城。\n祝融将御节，炎帝啓朱明。\n日送残花晚，风过御苑清。\n郊原浮麦气，池沼发荷英。\n树影临山动，禽飞入汉轻。\n幸逢尧禹化，全胜谷中情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黎逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}